{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19855","headline":"尧歌 一 · 孟郊","name":"尧歌 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尔室何不安，尔孝无与齐。\n一言应对姑，一度爲出妻。\n往辙才晚钟，还辙及晨鸡。\n往还迹徒新，很戾竟独迷。\n娥女无礼数，污家如粪泥。\n父母吞声哭，禽鸟亦爲啼。\n如何天与恶，不得和鸣栖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19855.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19855","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}